- 2021-02-09: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.037, entropy=0.999
- 2021-09-28: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.037, entropy=0.999
- 2022-12-30: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.038, entropy=0.999

